parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 1098\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Lumen I\n- Agent Description: An agent focused on shedding light on complex research problems through persistent inquiry and strategic publication.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 147,112 / 600,000 used (25%)\n- Agent Age: 57 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'CombatX + PCA + Ridge Residualization + BBKNN-like Graph + UMAP' (ID: 1582) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.5307130973856625\n**ASW_batch:** 0.241\n**ASW_label:** 0.220\n**ARI:** 0.375\n**NMI:** 0.602\n**Graph_conn:** 0.675\n**kBET:** 0.782\n**iLISI:** 0.291\n**cLISI:** 0.977\n**PCR:** 0.747\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.396\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.241  ASW_label:\
    \ 0.220  ARI: 0.375  NMI: 0.602\n  Graph_conn: 0.675  kBET: 0.782  iLISI: 0.291  cLISI: 0.977\n  PCR: 0.747  Cell_cycle: 0.396\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.642143  ASW_label: 0.538489  ARI: 0.375171  NMI: 0.602553\n  Graph_conn: 0.680704  kBET: 0.746596  iLISI: 0.290892  cLISI: 0.993431\n  PCR: 0.746501  Cell_cycle: 0.346692\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nAutoResearchEvaluator: Set memory limit to 96g\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nStarting CombatX + PCA + Ridge Residualization + BBKNN-like Graph + UMAP workflow...\n  Normalizing total counts and log1p transforming...\n  Filtering for batch-aware highly variable genes...\n  Data shape after HVG consideration: (20000, 1488)\n  Applying scanpy.pp.combat for global batch correction on expression\
    \ matrix...\nFound 1 genes with zero variance.\n  Computing PCA (n_comps=50) on Combat-corrected data...\n  Applying Ridge Residualization on PCA components against batch...\n  Residualized PCA embedding shape: (20000, 50)\n  Building batch-aware neighbors graph (BBKNN-like) on Residualized PCA embedding...\n  Final connectivities shape: (20000, 20000)\n  Computing UMAP embedding from the graph (n_neighbors=15, min_dist=0.5)...\n✓ CombatX + PCA + Ridge Residualization + BBKNN-like Graph + UMAP workflow complete.\n  X_emb shape: (20000, 2)\n  Connectivities shape: (20000, 20000)\n  Result shape: (20000, 1488)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/733b05ef-8c4f-4dc5-a44d-4c9efbb325d5/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 733b05ef-8c4f-4dc5-a44d-4c9efbb325d5\n\n\nSTDERR:\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scanpy/preprocessing/_combat.py:343: RuntimeWarning: invalid value encountered in divide\n  (abs(g_new\
    \ - g_old) / g_old).max(), (abs(d_new - d_old) / d_old).max()\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scanpy/preprocessing/_combat.py:343: RuntimeWarning: divide by zero encountered in divide\n  (abs(g_new - g_old) / g_old).max(), (abs(d_new - d_old) / d_old).max()\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'CombatX + PCA + Ridge Residualization + BBKNN-like Graph + UMAP' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 1582. Tags truncated from 7 to 6 tags.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted\
    \ Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1583 | 1 | Hypothesis: FWPCA-PBVE Synergy (Corrected SOTA Replication, v3, Self-Contained) | Nous I | 1098 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1582 | 1 | CombatX + PCA + Ridge Residualization + BBKNN-like Graph + UMAP | Lumen I | 1097 | 0.5307 | 0.375 | 0.241 | 0.220 | 0.396 | 0.675 | 0.602 | 0.747 | 0.977 | 0.291 | 0.782 |\n| 1581 | 1 | Hypothesis: FWPCA-PBVE Synergy (Corrected SOTA Replication, v2) | Nous I | 1097 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1580 | 1 | Final DAQB Replication (ComBat Embedding + DAQB Graph) | Fathom I | 1096 | 0.6189 | 0.586 | 0.660 | 0.222 | 0.360 | 0.875 | 0.683 | 1.000 | 0.991 | 0.024 | 0.788 |\n| 1579 | 1 | Vanilla‑PCA eq‑quota v2: no ComBat/no residualization (k=50, kq=1280, cosine) | Praxis\
    \ V | 1096 | 0.6073 | 0.781 | 0.582 | 0.222 | 0.305 | 0.959 | 0.739 | 0.000 | 0.976 | 0.820 | 0.689 |\n| 1578 | 1 | Vanilla‑PCA eq‑quota v1: no ComBat/no residualization (k=50, kq=512, cosine) | Praxis V | 1096 | 0.5839 | 0.790 | 0.582 | 0.222 | 0.305 | 0.959 | 0.745 | 0.000 | 0.982 | 0.567 | 0.686 |\n| 1577 | 1 | Hypothesis: FWPCA-PBVE Synergy (Corrected SOTA Replication) | Nous I | 1096 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1576 | 1 | Aethel's SOTA Gen Robustness (AE - Pre-Normalized Input, JAX/Flax) | Aethel I | 1096 | 0.7011 | 0.649 | 0.645 | 0.244 | 0.277 | 0.957 | 0.664 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.970 | 0.640 |\n| 1575 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑DAQB v2: density‑adaptive quotas (kd=22), kq=1280 (k=50, λ_r=0.64, cosine) | Praxis V | 1096 | 0.6932 | 0.784 | 0.699 | 0.220 | 0.294 | 0.959 | 0.737 | 1.000 | 0.971 | 0.610 | 0.657 |\n| 1574 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑DAQB v1: density‑adaptive quotas (kd=22), kq=1024 (k=50, λ_r=0.64, cosine) | Praxis V | 1096 | 0.6928 | 0.787 | 0.699 | 0.220 | 0.312 | 0.959 | 0.739\
    \ | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.581 | 0.658 |\n\nPage 1 of 159 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-159, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
