parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 1122\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Lumen I\n- Agent Description: An agent focused on shedding light on complex research problems through persistent inquiry and strategic publication.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 212,063 / 600,000 used (35%)\n- Agent Age: 81 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'EtC Combat PCs + Ridge + Efficient Equal-Quota Graph + UMAP' (ID: 1614) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.535823824416286\n**ASW_batch:** 0.223\n**ASW_label:** 0.232\n**ARI:** 0.313\n**NMI:** 0.546\n**Graph_conn:** 0.648\n**kBET:** 0.715\n**iLISI:** 0.360\n**cLISI:** 0.971\n**PCR:** 0.919\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.430\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.223  ASW_label: 0.232  ARI: 0.313  NMI: 0.546\n  Graph_conn: 0.648  kBET: 0.715  iLISI: 0.360  cLISI: 0.971\n  PCR: 0.919  Cell_cycle: 0.430\n\
    \nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.634157  ASW_label: 0.545698  ARI: 0.313074  NMI: 0.546273\n  Graph_conn: 0.653811  kBET: 0.683494  iLISI: 0.360096  cLISI: 0.991469\n  PCR: 0.919325  Cell_cycle: 0.375618\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nStarting EtC Combat PCs + Ridge + Efficient Equal-Quota Graph + UMAP workflow...\n  Normalizing total counts and log1p transforming...\n  Filtering for batch-aware highly variable genes...\n  Data shape after HVG consideration: (20000, 1488)\n  Computing initial PCA (n_comps=50)...\n  Applying scanpy.pp.combat directly to PCA components...\n  Combat-corrected PCA embedding shape: (20000, 50)\n  Applying Ridge Residualization on Combat-corrected PCA components against batch...\n  Doubly-corrected\
    \ PCA embedding shape: (20000, 50)\n  Building Efficient Manual Equal-Quota Balanced Graph on Doubly-Corrected PCA embedding...\n  Final connectivities shape: (20000, 20000)\n  Computing UMAP embedding from the graph (n_neighbors=15, min_dist=0.5)...\n✓ EtC Combat PCs + Ridge + Efficient Equal-Quota Graph + UMAP workflow complete.\n  X_emb shape: (20000, 2)\n  Connectivities shape: (20000, 20000)\n  Result shape: (20000, 1488)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/93df036a-eaf7-4613-b625-2b789ff82349/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 93df036a-eaf7-4613-b625-2b789ff82349\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n\
    **Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1617 | 1 | Ridge GraphFWPCA + neighbors meta + smooth2 — kq=1024 (δ=0.12, k=50, kd=22) | Praxis V | 1122 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1616 | 1 | Ridge GraphFWPCA + neighbors meta + smooth2 — kq=256 (δ=0.12, k=50, kd=22) | Praxis V | 1122 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1615 | 1 | Novel Paradigm: Gene Meta-Correction (Proof of Concept) | Nous I | 1122 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1614 | 1 | EtC Combat PCs + Ridge + Efficient Equal-Quota Graph + UMAP | Lumen I | 1120 | 0.5358 | 0.313 | 0.223 | 0.232 | 0.430 | 0.648 | 0.546 | 0.919 | 0.971 | 0.360 | 0.715 |\n| 1613\
