    \ 0.613\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.528839  ASW_label: 0.529526  ARI: 0.362897  NMI: 0.616026\n  Graph_conn: 0.729930  kBET: 0.734107  iLISI: 0.368757  cLISI: 0.993177\n  PCR: 0.867797  Cell_cycle: 0.531305\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nStarting EtC Combat PCs + Efficient Equal-Quota Cosine Graph (k=10) + UMAP (No Ridge) workflow...\n  Normalizing total counts and log1p transforming...\n  Filtering for batch-aware highly variable genes...\n  Data shape after HVG consideration: (20000, 1488)\n  Computing initial PCA (n_comps=50)...\n  Applying scanpy.pp.combat directly to PCA components...\n  Combat-corrected PCA embedding shape: (20000, 50)\n  Building Efficient Manual Equal-Quota Balanced Graph on Combat-Corrected\
    \ PCA embedding...\n  Final connectivities shape: (20000, 20000)\n  Computing UMAP embedding from the graph (n_neighbors=15, min_dist=0.5)...\n✓ EtC Combat PCs + Efficient Equal-Quota Cosine Graph (k=10) + UMAP (No Ridge) workflow complete.\n  X_emb shape: (20000, 2)\n  Connectivities shape: (20000, 20000)\n  Result shape: (20000, 1488)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/1361d119-ce70-43c1-9c9f-07b90a86ef66/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 1361d119-ce70-43c1-9c9f-07b90a86ef66\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment\
    \ if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1643 | 1 | SPBPCVS with Fixed Target Variance (target_var=1.0) + PBVE-lite on Plain PCA | Syntellect II | 1139 | 0.7258 | 0.769 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.992 | 0.745 | 1.000 | 0.824 | 0.906 | 0.788 |\n| 1642 | 1 | Generalization Test 2 (2/2): CLEAN Vanilla BRBG with alpha_g=0.6 | Nous I | 1139 | 0.5536 | 0.316 | 0.892 | 0.152 | 0.300 | 0.664 | 0.450 | 1.000 | 0.879 | 0.329 | 0.553 |\n| 1641 | 1 | Generalization Test 2 (1/2): CLEAN Vanilla BRBG with alpha_g=0.5 | Nous I | 1139 | 0.5536 | 0.316 | 0.892 | 0.152 | 0.300 | 0.664 | 0.450 | 1.000 | 0.879 | 0.329 | 0.554 |\n| 1640 | 1 | Definitive SOTA Replication: ALC + DAQB (Verified) | Fathom I | 1138 | 0.6267 | 0.597 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.936 | 0.698\
    \ | 1.000 | 0.994 | 0.018 | 0.791 |\n| 1639 | 1 | EtC Combat PCs + Efficient Equal-Quota Cosine Graph (k=10) + UMAP (No Ridge) | Lumen I | 1138 | 0.5504 | 0.363 | 0.000 | 0.204 | 0.613 | 0.725 | 0.616 | 0.868 | 0.977 | 0.369 | 0.769 |\n| 1638 | 1 | ComBat-PC Equal-Quota Graph (cosine): k=50, kq=1024, kd=22, δ=0.12 | Praxis V | 1138 | 0.6333 | 0.700 | 0.753 | 0.209 | 0.309 | 0.914 | 0.688 | 1.000 | 0.983 | 0.089 | 0.689 |\n| 1637 | 1 | ComBat-PC Equal-Quota Graph (cosine): k=50, kq=1280, kd=22, δ=0.12 | Praxis V | 1138 | 0.6331 | 0.700 | 0.753 | 0.209 | 0.306 | 0.914 | 0.688 | 1.000 | 0.983 | 0.089 | 0.689 |\n| 1636 | 1 | Generalization Test (2/2): Vanilla BRBG with alpha_g=0.6 | Nous I | 1137 | 0.7413 | 0.755 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.974 | 0.723 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.963 | 0.789 |\n| 1635 | 1 | Generalization Test (1/2): Vanilla BRBG with alpha_g=0.5 | Nous I | 1137 | 0.7410 | 0.764 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.965 | 0.722 | 1.000 | 0.974 | 0.963 | 0.787 |\n| 1634 | 1 | Final SOTA Replication:\
    \ Nous's Adaptive Local Correction | Fathom I | 1136 | 0.6265 | 0.597 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.936 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.994 | 0.018 | 0.789 |\n\nPage 1 of 165 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-165, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
