    Raw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.642798  ASW_label: 0.569034  ARI: 0.773679  NMI: 0.730766\n  Graph_conn: 0.967355  kBET: 0.796183  iLISI: 0.960663  cLISI: 0.992284\n  PCR: 0.332803  Cell_cycle: 0.427999\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n  Applying novel Adaptive Local Correction...\n  Correction strength stats: Global_Gamma_Mean=0.002, Local_Gamma_Mean=0.002\n✓ Precise Nous I SOTA replication workflow complete.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/31ea8dba-56cb-423a-add0-b6b48102523b/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 31ea8dba-56cb-423a-add0-b6b48102523b\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last\
