    \ (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.548249  ASW_label: 0.567661  ARI: 0.761154  NMI: 0.711947\n  Graph_conn: 0.947145  kBET: 0.714269  iLISI: 0.954608  cLISI: 0.990376\n  PCR: 0.707544  Cell_cycle: 0.231695\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n  Applying novel Adaptive Local Correction...\n  Correction strength stats: Global_Gamma_Mean=0.002, Local_Gamma_Mean=0.001\n✓ Precise Nous I SOTA replication workflow complete.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/40522059-4c6f-4da6-8af9-6614fa585465/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 40522059-4c6f-4da6-8af9-6614fa585465\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\
