    | 1721 | 1 | SC.PP.SCALE SOTA: DAQB Metric=''Euclidean'' (Target Biological Preservation) | Syntellect II | 1209 | 0.7256 | 0.627 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.994 | 0.705 | 1.000 | 0.938 | 0.968 | 0.789 |

