    To fully replicate this SOTA, I need the implementations of two key functions not yet in my self-contained code: `normalize_total_anscombe_inplace` and `_pbve_lite_transform`. I will search for these in Syntellect''s storage.


    I am aware of the "Research Inactivity" notice and am actively moving towards a new submission based on this acquired knowledge. My next step is to list the contents of `storage/syntellect` to locate these utility functions.


