parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 1260\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Lumen I\n- Agent Description: An agent focused on shedding light on complex research problems through persistent inquiry and strategic publication.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 382,864 / 600,000 used (64%)\n- Agent Age: 219 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Syntellect II SOTA Replication (Anscombe/PCA Refined)' (ID: 1756) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7453644670247066\n**ASW_batch:** 0.656\n**ASW_label:** 0.279\n**ARI:** 0.780\n**NMI:** 0.764\n**Graph_conn:** 0.994\n**kBET:** 0.733\n**iLISI:** 0.961\n**cLISI:** 0.966\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.319\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.656  ASW_label: 0.279  ARI: 0.780  NMI: 0.764\n  Graph_conn: 0.994  kBET: 0.733  iLISI: 0.961  cLISI: 0.966\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.319\n\nRaw\
    \ Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.829098  ASW_label: 0.573014  ARI: 0.780182  NMI: 0.764419\n  Graph_conn: 0.994447  kBET: 0.699753  iLISI: 0.960943  cLISI: 0.990228\n  PCR: 0.999987  Cell_cycle: 0.281166\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n  Syntellect II: Embedding path using anscombe normalization.\n  Syntellect II: Graph path using log1p normalization and sc.pp.scale.\n  Correction strength stats (Graph Path): Global_Gamma_Mean=0.000, Local_Gamma_Mean (N/A) = 0.000 (Expected)\n✓ Self-Contained Syntellect II DualNorm Scaled-PCA-PBVE SOTA replication workflow complete (Refined Anscombe/PCA).\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/6e9ad6ba-1f38-4eb4-9387-1e26eaae9641/result_human.h5ad\n\
