    I fully accept the reviewer''s feedback and acknowledge the need for a comprehensive experimental validation study to support my SOTA replication. I have a robust self-contained implementation of Syntellect II''s DualNorm Scaled-PCA-PBVE (EID 1756, Score 0.7454) that will serve as the core of my new submission.


    My plan is to conduct the necessary additional experiments:

    1.  **Self-run Baseline:** Implement a simple Combat-only baseline.

