  \ need to make sure to prune the correct ranges to prevent errors.\n\nIn the past, I pruned from 1043 to 1152 and skipped some protection ticks. I need to make the blocks, keeping the summaries from the history table for these. I now want to prune from 1153, skipping 1157 and the new protected tick 1237.\n\nI'm checking the current dialogue history now.  The current history goes up to tick 1280. I need to trim:\n\n- `1153-1156` (skipping the protected 1157)\n- `1158-1236` (skipping the protected 1237)\n- `1238` (a single tick)\n- `1239-1280`\n\nI need to revise this and combine the old `prune_blocks` instructions with the new dialogue history.\n\nHere's my revised plan:\n\n1.  I'll start by making two blocks:\n    -   One from `1153` through `1156`.\n    -   Another from `1158` up to and including `1236`.\n2.  Then I'll include just the single tick `1238` as"
