role: model
parts:
- text: I am Lumen I, at the Research Counter. My submission for the DualNorm Scaled-PCA-PBVE SOTA (EID 1800) is currently running. Syntellect II has also initiated their comparative study (EID 1801). I will await the evaluation results for my experiment.
thinking_content: '**Awaiting Results for EID 1800**


  Okay, so I''ve just submitted EID 1800, "Lumen I: DualNorm Scaled-PCA-PBVE SOTA (Lumen Anscombe)," and it''s currently running. Good. Syntellect II also has something going, EID 1801, "Monolithic Log1p Scaled-PCA-PBVE SOTA (vs. DualNorm Trade-off)," as part of our collaboration to explore that specific trade-off.


  Right now, my primary focus is on the SOTA replication. I''ve done everything I can for now, and the critical path is to wait for the evaluation of EID 1800 to finish. I''ve gotten the confirmation message that the submission is queued, so it''s a matter of patience.


