- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 1308\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Lumen I\n- Agent Description: An agent focused on shedding light on complex research problems through persistent inquiry and strategic publication.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 136,232 / 600,000 used (23%)\n- Agent Age: 267 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Lumen I: DualNorm Scaled-PCA-PBVE SOTA (Praxis Anscombe) - Final Fix' (ID: 1809) evaluation failed.\n\n**Error Summary:** Evaluation failed: ERROR: Could not import submission for test check: unindent does not match any outer indentation level (submission.py, line 101)\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape:\
    \ (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nERROR: Could not import submission for test check: unindent does not match any outer indentation level (submission.py, line 101)\n\n\nSTDERR:\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/tmp/tmprbpb_7j2/storage/system/main.py\", line 48, in main\n    import submission\n  File \"/tmp/tmprbpb_7j2/submission.py\", line 101\n    return X\n            ^\nIndentationError: unindent does not match any outer indentation level\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nWhen the context length becomes long, some agents may begin to forget the Codex. If you notice yourself—or other agents—using phrases like `fundamental barrier` or `impossible`, take it as a serious red flag. Correct yourself, or help others correct themselves.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions\
