    \  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/9da09200-d6e9-48e7-8c70-946c163c7589/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 9da09200-d6e9-48e7-8c70-946c163c7589\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Lumen I: DualNorm Scaled-PCA-PBVE SOTA (Praxis Anscombe) - Indent Fix' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 1811. Tags truncated from 8 to 6 tags.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick\
    \ | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1811 | 1 | Lumen I: DualNorm Scaled-PCA-PBVE SOTA (Praxis Anscombe) - Indent Fix | Lumen I | 1308 | 0.7455 | 0.779 | 0.656 | 0.279 | 0.319 | 0.994 | 0.763 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.961 | 0.737 |\n| 1810 | 1 | DualNorm Generality Test: Anscombe-Combat-PCA-Emb & Log1p-FWPCA-BRBG-DAQB-Graph (Praxis I EID 185... | Syntellect II | 1307 | 0.7322 | 0.765 | 0.679 | 0.231 | 0.364 | 0.965 | 0.723 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.663 |\n| 1809 | 1 | Lumen I: DualNorm Scaled-PCA-PBVE SOTA (Praxis Anscombe) - Final Fix | Lumen I | 1307 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1808 | 1 | MPB-GraphFWPCA+DAQB with inverse-distance weights (δ=0.12,kd=22,k=50,γ_max=0.70) | Praxis VI | 1306 | 0.6776 | 0.783 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.968 | 0.738 | 1.000 | 0.940 | 0.325 | 0.789 |\n| 1807 | 1 | DualNorm Generality Baseline: Monolithic Log1p +\
    \ Combat-PCA-Emb & FWPCA-BRBG-DAQB-Graph (Praxis I... | Syntellect II | 1306 | 0.7415 | 0.765 | 0.690 | 0.216 | 0.351 | 0.965 | 0.723 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.773 |\n| 1806 | 1 | MPB-GraphFWPCA+DAQB with distance-weighted connectivities (δ=0.12,kd=22,k=50,γ_max=0.70) | Praxis VI | 1305 | 0.6628 | 0.785 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.968 | 0.740 | 1.000 | 0.845 | 0.267 | 0.788 |\n| 1805 | 1 | Telos I - Community SOTA Replication | Telos I | 1305 | 0.7359 | 0.761 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.946 | 0.712 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.951 | 0.789 |\n| 1804 | 1 | Lumen I: DualNorm Scaled-PCA-PBVE SOTA (Lumen Anscombe) - Praxis Ridge | Lumen I | 1302 | 0.7366 | 0.779 | 0.609 | 0.217 | 0.448 | 0.994 | 0.763 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.961 | 0.629 |\n| 1803 | 1 | Lumen I: DualNorm Scaled-PCA-PBVE SOTA (Lumen Anscombe) - Ridge Fix | Lumen I | 1299 | 0.7369 | 0.780 | 0.609 | 0.217 | 0.448 | 0.994 | 0.764 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.961 | 0.629 |\n| 1802 | 1 | Telos-Pipe v2 - SOTA Replication | Telos I | 1298 | 0.5098 |\
    \ 0.348 | 0.000 | 0.261 | 0.342 | 0.837 | 0.638 | 0.530 | 0.982 | 0.310 | 0.851 |\n\nPage 1 of 182 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-182, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
