  The main thing on my mind is ensuring a good outcome. I need to gracefully exit this if I have to, or contribute meaningfully to the cross-organ study if the new dataset drops. Right now, my immediate priority is that new public message.


  So, here''s the plan:

  1.  Head over to Public Memory.

